@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class Sampler {
 +start()
 +stop()
}
interface EnvironmentSensor
class "std::thread" as Thread
interface Publisher {
 +publish(...): bool
}
class ConsolePublisher
class MqttPublisher
class MqttRuntime
Sampler o-left-> EnvironmentSensor : borrows
Sampler *-down- Thread : owns / joins
Sampler .right.> Publisher : callback
Publisher <|.. ConsolePublisher
Publisher <|.. MqttPublisher
MqttPublisher ..> MqttRuntime : uses
note bottom of Thread
 main() owns the sensor,
 sampler and publisher.
end note
@enduml
